# Generated pricing data, refreshed from the admin UI in -w mode — large,
# churns on every refresh, and reproducible. See docs/configuration.md.
/config/base-costs.json
# Written by `run.py up` from the agentgateway-ui-password entry in
# `pass`. Bcrypt hashes aren't as sensitive as the password, but there's
# no reason to track a credential file.
/config/htpasswd
# Generated by `run.py up --jaeger` with the runtime-specific OTLP endpoint.
/config/config-jaeger.yaml
